# 🏭 FactoryMind: A Multi-Agent AI Manufacturing Factory

> **Where Six AI Agents Run a Factory, Together.**

An intelligent smart-factory simulation platform where six specialized AI agents — **Production, Quality, Maintenance, Inventory, Logistics, and Energy** — collaborate in real-time to autonomously manage and optimize an entire manufacturing ecosystem.

Powered by **Google Gemini API** for reasoning and decision-making, built with a **FastAPI (Python) backend** and a **React-based modern dashboard**.

